# The Bridge — environment / secrets reference.
# Secrets are NOT stored in this repo. In production they live in Wrangler secrets:
#   wrangler secret put JWT_SECRET      # random 32+ byte string, signs JWTs
#   wrangler secret put INGEST_TOKEN    # bearer token for POST /api/ingest
#
# For local `wrangler dev`, put them in .dev.vars (git-ignored):
#   JWT_SECRET="a-long-random-development-secret-value"
#   INGEST_TOKEN="local-ingest-token"
